    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Installation of a 1-MW photovoltaic plant, including battery storage transmission, connecting the RFM Hospital:

PV power plant: 1 MW peak installed capacity
battery storage system: 900 kWh lithium-ion battery storage
Number of step-up/down transformers: 2 x 1MW step-up/down transformers
Number of high-energy bulbs and fittings replaced with LED lamps: 976 LEDs and fittings, 2009 LEDs</narrative>
